# Brazen Bluff: declining the exile lets its controller cast "a noncreature spell from your hand" for free. Grist, the Hunger Tide is a
# planeswalker card, but while it is not on the battlefield it is a 1/1 Insect creature in addition (every zone), so as a spell it is a creature
# spell (CR 601.3e): the spell it would be is judged, not its printed type line, so only Shock is offered and Grist stays in hand.

[Bot1 Deck]
Brazen Bluff
Mox Ruby
Gleemox
Shock
Grist, the Hunger Tide
Mountain x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Shock
Island x20

